                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Too many veterans face unnecessary barriers to the care and benefits they\u2019ve rightfully earned. That\u2019s why I proudly voted for H.R. 8371, the Senator Elizabeth Dole 21st Century Veterans Healthcare and Benefits Improvement Act, which addresses inefficiencies within the VA to improve services and expand benefits.\n\nAs a veteran, I understand these challenges firsthand. This bill includes bipartisan measures I co-sponsored, such as H.R. 3520, the Veterans Care Improvement Act, further ensuring that veterans, their families, and survivors receive the quality care, improved services, and increased benefits they deserve.",
                "text_lang": "en",
