                "text": "Team Mills, alongside local organizations and nonprofit organizations, attended the ribbon-cutting for the new Orlando Health Lake Mary community hospital. This new facility will improve healthcare services available to the community in Florida\u2019s 7th Congressional District. https://t.co/zPB62nwTLS",
