                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Team Mills attended the Private Business Association meeting to listen in on presentations from key healthcare providers in Florida\u2019s 7th Congressional District. They discussed the current state and hurdles facing the healthcare system. Presenters included the Hospital Corporation of America (HCA), Advent Health, and Orlando Health.",
