                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Team Mills met with Brittany Corfman Parks, the Grassroots Engagement Coordinator for Concerned Veterans for America (CVA), to discuss the Veterans\u2019 ACCESS Act. We are committed to ensuring our veterans receive the timely and quality healthcare services and benefits they deserve after bravely serving our nation.",
