                "reply_count": 132,
                "retweet_count": 423,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Democrats are LYING when they say the One Big Beautiful Bill is cutting access to essential programs like SNAP and Medicaid.\n\nThe fact is the One Big Beautiful Bio protects Medicaid and SNAP, keeping them FULLY available for everyone entitled to them. It only affects people who are fraudulently abusing the programs and should not have been on them in the first place. \n\nThis is personal for me as I was adopted and my family benefited from programs like Medicaid and SNAP growing up. Protecting and strengthening these programs is a priority for me.",
