                "retweet_count": 33,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "MYTH BUSTED: The One Big Beautiful Bill does NOT kick American families off Medicaid! President Trump has made it clear: NO CUTS to Medicaid. This bill protects and strengthens Medicaid for pregnant women, children, seniors, people with disabilities, and low-income families. We're eliminating waste, fraud, and abuse, removing illegal aliens, and enforcing work requirements to ensure Medicaid remains strong for the truly vulnerable. I will always keep fighting for our most vulnerable citizens!",
