                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I voted in favor of H.R. 498, the Do No Harm in Medicaid Act, to protect Florida\u2019s children and ensure responsible use of taxpayer dollars.\n\nFloridians expect Medicaid to focus on providing essential care for vulnerable families, not funding irreversible gender transition procedures on minors, including surgeries and hormone treatments. This bill puts clear guardrails in place to protect kids and preserve Medicaid resources for those who truly need them here in Florida.\n\nI\u2019ll continue fighting for commonsense policies that protect children, respect families, and put Florida taxpayers first.",
